<i>TURN-A</i>

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.110
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:06.690
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:07.110
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:07.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:29.610
<i>A mobile suit came out of the White Doll statue and began to move.</i>

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.610
<i>And in Vicinity, Master Heim was killed,</i>

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:35.110
<i>and Lady Sochie was deeply saddened.</i>

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:36.820
<i>Keith also arrived.</i>

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.120
<i>Neither of us have any idea what to do with this mobile suit.</i>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:50.920
<b>Soldiers From the Homeland</b>

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.310
Where's the enemy?

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.390
How do I use the VR head?

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:07.480
Where's the manual?

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:11.770
VR head!

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:12.770
It worked.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.700
<i>Rename "Unknown A" to "WaDom."</i>

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.240
Now change new model "B" to "WaD" type.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.410
<i>"W.A.D."!</i>

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.410
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:29.210
<i>We're all set!</i>

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.210
Once the smoke goes off, they won't be able to fire their guns, right?

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.420
<i>You dumbass! We won't be able to see the enemy either!</i>

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.510
<i>Here we go!</i>

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.420
<i>Fire!</i>

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:45.890
<i>5 Kilos away?</i>

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.390
<i>No, it's from a distance of 4700 meters away.</i>

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.230
<i>Ensign Poe, take out the cannon that just fired at us.</i>

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:53.560
<i>Ensign Poe, your WaDom should be able to do this!</i>

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.700
The anti-aircraft cannons are finished.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.410
Those militia small fries are just ruining their own farmland.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.500
We need to use this land for our own crops someday...

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.880
<i>A real mobile suit is here.</i>

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.420
<i>Did you check the radar?</i>

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.010
<i>There shouldn't be anything like this on Earth.</i>

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.800
Which is exactly why we need to capture it for research purposes!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.100
That suit is incomplete. We can capture it!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.520
Aren't WaDs anti-personnel weapons?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.640
They're coming from the left and right...

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.390
<i>Both sides?</i>

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.400
If I can contact that WaDom, I might be able to stop this batt-

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.330
What are you doing?! Stop this at once!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.630
Captain, the body of the Mustache's rifle is melted!

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.420
It's using a useless weapon?

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.430
Is he luring us into a trap to take us all out at once?

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.720
Its beam rifle <i>is</i> damaged!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.020
What a huge mobile suit!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.530
Stop this destruction!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.160
He's fast!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.750
He's escaping! Burn the forrest if you have to!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.590
<i>They're getting closer, Jessica.</i>

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.220
Milady Sochie, Please wake up!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.090
<i>It might become dangerous to stay here!</i>

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:49.100
<i>Jessica, have you loaded all the luggage into the car?</i>

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.220
<i>I packed the important things.</i>

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.520
Is Loran fighting?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.620
<i>Please stop! I have no intention of fighting!</i>

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.120
If you really don't want to fight,

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.420
then there's no reason to pilot that mobile suit!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:21.210
<i>If such a powerful mobile suit belongs to the militia, then we have to capture it!</i>

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:25.930
If that's what you say, then I'll just crush you right here!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:28.720
Just try it! The WaDom will take you out!

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.100
Are you kidding?!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.390
The WaD can't attack if it's off the ground!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.020
<i>If you don't retreat, I really will fight back!</i>

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.030
<i>If you do, I'll let these two go.</i>

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.030
I knew it! They were after the White Doll!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.320
It's just like Lord Guin said.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.490
Lets go!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.210
The people of Earth are too needlessly aggressive.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.500
Damn!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.630
Where's Miashei?!

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.010
Papa!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.510
Miashei!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:16.230
Don't fall! You scared the crap out of me!

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.600
Yeah. Sorry.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.110
Don't raze our fields!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:25.030
Get rid of the aliens!

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:29.410
Protect the fields! We'll kick those foreigners off our property!

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.990
How uncivilized.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:34.120
You can't describe the Terrans as anything but barbaric!

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:41.500
They're attacking me with ancient weapons, and their civilization is dated.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.500
But no matter how I look at it, that's a mobile suit...

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.420
and it looks brand new at that!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:47.920
<i>Ensign Poe!</i>

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:48.920
What do you want?!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.590
<i>Requesting permission to retaliate against the Terrans!</i>

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.050
The goal is to use as little force as possible!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.520
- How'dya like that Mr. blows up a lot!?
- Damn piece of crap!
- You deserved it!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.110
That's Her Majesty Dianna's orders!

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:08.820
Her Majesty Dianna ordered them not to attack humans!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.200
Don't let them get into the town!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:21.620
They're running!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:22.620
They disappeared?

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.290
The guys on the ground are running away too!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.970
Miashei! We're going full throttle! Let's get 'em!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.930
We're all outta ammo! What are you gonna do, ram them?!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:33.930
Are we really?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.010
They ran away?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:39.020
I don't think it's because the militia came out...

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.480
I wonder if it's because of the rain, or something?

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:48.030
<i>I never gave you permission to fight.</i>

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:52.700
I thought we'd need information on the enemy mobile suit for the sake of the negotiations.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.820
If we were to capture it,

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.910
...it would give our side an edge when negotiating.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.700
<i>It is us who will decide such matters.</i>

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.500
<i>A second transport will be arriving shortly.</i>

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.500
<i>Your first priority will be to ensure its safety.</i>

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:07.630
How can we return to the Earth just by sitting in a chair and talking?

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.550
This is turning into a war.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.510
<i>Are the drivers dead?</i>

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.720
<i>We'll find out. Give me a sec to open it.</i>

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:21.390
It's open!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:22.810
There are humans inside!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.900
How dare you come out here and wreck our fields!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.860
Wait! Please, don't shoot!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:27.400
Shut up!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:28.400
<i>Don't do it!</i>

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:29.530
What was that?!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:32.530
Don't lower your gun at a surrendering POW!

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.910
Are you one of them?!

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.570
I'm the one driving the White Doll!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.950
Then this is the militia's mustached doll!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.330
Mustached doll?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.290
<i>We wanna get these guys to tell us how to start up these machines!</i>

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.210
<i>Loran! I'm truly sorry about what happened to Master Heim!</i>

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.210
Is it true that Sochie's alright?

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:51.630
She's fine!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:08.310
There are already mourners out on the street.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.690
What are you looking at outside?

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:10.900
Just the rain.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.400
What's that smell?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:16.030
Mechanical dolls came down from the sky and set the city on fire.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.200
Oh, so that's what happened.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.410
Have you gotten in touch with Sam?

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:23.410
I contacted Vicinity by telephone.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.620
It's been ruined as well.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:29.460
I see. That's terrible.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.920
Father has... passed away.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.920
Diran... is dead?

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:39.600
They said the light from the mechanical doll hit our house, and Father was killed in the blast.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.510
Mother?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.510
He's dead.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.890
Mother...

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.020
M-Mother!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.180
The Earth's rain is rather warm.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:22.930
This green Earth... is our homeland.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:28.020
Loran went out to fight in the mechanical doll that came out of the White Doll.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.400
The men have all joined the militia to fight,

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.530
yet you, the one who's always wanted to fly planes, are still in bed.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.690
What would your father think?

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:40.200
<i>There's no way he'd ever acknowledge you as an heir to the Heim Family!</i>

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:44.490
Is it true that Loran's using the mechanical doll?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:48.120
They say he beat the enemy's mechanical dolls with it!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.620
He's really something!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.210
Loran did that?

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:55.130
But hey, we can't afford to relax yet.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.010
We still need more fighter pilots.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.720
I've got a plan. Can you help me?

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:03.220
Don't you want to avenge your father?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.560
Revenge...

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.730
That's why you should learn how to pilot a fighter plane.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.400
So I can avenge him!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.830
I wonder if Miashei was able to cheer Sochie up.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.720
There's an enemy suit approaching. Is it a WaDom?

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.810
I can't let it get close to the house.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.310
I wonder what it's looking for?

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.700
So this is the Earth's wind.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.370
Strange. All the metal reaction's in the Earth's ground are gone.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:25.140
Dianna Counter pilot!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.720
l'm of the Moonrace!

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.930
Two years ago, I was sent here to evaluate the Earth's environment.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.730
<i>My name is Loran Cehack!</i>

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.100
Hold on a sec!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.070
That was a woman.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.070
Is she the one I fought against twice?

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.710
So the Return ships and Dianna Counter came here together?

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.920
Well, we've encountered a bit of resistance, right?. But hey,

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:05.930
<i>If more mobile suits like that Mustached one exist down here, then there's good reason for it.</i>

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.890
Get outta here, foreigners! Give us our land back!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.810
Isn't that Loran in that suit's hand?

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.770
Was he lying when he said he was staying in Vicinity?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.310
Get lost!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:20.730
<i>No way.</i>

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.610
<i>There's others like the While Doll still out there!?</i>

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:27.530
At this rate, Loran's gonna become a hero in no time.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:31.410
Then Sid's men are searching the mountain for more things from the Dark History, because....

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.120
They may be able to find more mechanical dolls like the White Doll.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.420
That's what Guin Rhineford is hoping for.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.420
In battle, he who's two steps ahead gains victory.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.710
It's from old man Sid!

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.430
I heard a crash in the mine. Are you alright?

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.140
Yeah, they're all here.

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.300
Did he find more mechanical dolls?!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:53.600
There's another tunnel in the mine, and it's is different from the one in this mountain.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.930
Old man Sid?!

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.600
Another cave-in?!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:57.810
Old man Sid?!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.020
Gather our rescue team!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:03.360
Colonel Michael has ordered us to speed up the mining operation!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:07.400
<i>We need to hurry up and excavate more artifacts from the Dark History! Got it?!</i>

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.110
Loran Cehack.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:14.620
Born November 2nd, 2328 Correct Century, in the Meizan region.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:18.710
Upon graduating middle school, I was sent here to Earth on FLAT Unit Two.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.500
You've done a fine job over the past two years.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.920
You appear to be quite healthy, both mentally and physically.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.130
S-sir!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:30.140
The machines analyzing your bodily functions are no longer necessary.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.140
Sir.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:34.930
From this point on, you are free to do as you please.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.020
<i>Thank you very much, sir.</i>

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.730
- What's this?
- Hmm?

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.060
You're carrying a goldfish?

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:44.020
O-Oh, this. I got permission to take it with me.

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:47.900
Was that a beloved toy from your days as a baby?

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:50.570
This is the only thing I have to remember the moon by.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:55.120
Could you please repeat to us what you told Ensign Poe?

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:59.040
I'd never heard any rumors suggesting Mobile Suits were in Vicinity.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.710
But, on the night of the Coming of Age Ceremony,

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.340
the WaDom attacked the Mountain Cycle.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.010
The stone statue known as the "White Doll" crumbled,

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.800
and a mobile suit appeared from within.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.890
My house burned down because of the air strike,

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.310
and I was too busy putting out the fires to realize what had happened.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.230
So you haven't heard any rumors of the militia attempting to use mobile suits?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.980
I'm just my Master's family's chaffeur,

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.730
so I haven't learned much outside of my duties.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:25.520
I understand.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:29.320
They don't seem to have the kind of natural resources necessary to manufacture mobile suits.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.030
We can't afford to assume such things!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:35.370
I know what the militia's factories are capable of manufacturing, sir.

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.540
Because of your experience at Heim Mine?

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.410
Yeah, exactly.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.630
Captain!

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:50.420
I told you, he's far too tense. Let him sit down.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.010
Take a deep breath, Loran.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:01.310
I-I'm really sorry, sir. I just passed out all of a sudden.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:04.730
It must be quite a relief to reunite with the Moonrace after such a long time.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:10.530
What do you know about the Dark History? All this talk about tales of their great Gods?

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:14.410
Sometime after the mechanical doll emerged from the White Doll...

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.830
I saw a drawing that resembled it in some picture book.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.330
- But...
- But?

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:22.210
A miner named Sid told me he could dig up space machines

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:26.210
for the militia that would prove the existence of the Dark History.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.130
He's been mining everywhere in the mountains to find them.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.510
I've only fought one of these mechanical dolls, sir.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:36.220
I don't know if they'll find anything other than the White Doll,

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:41.180
but Guin Rhineford has ordered them to keep digging.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:46.100
Lieutenant Harry, as you head for the city, take Loran with you so that you may continue asking questions.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:01.540
I'm hoping that you'll be able to get some information from this man called Sid.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.410
Right. I should be able to.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:06.630
Just how big is this mustached White Doll?

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.420
About twice the size of that.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:12.420
Then it's somewhere around the same size as my SUMO.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:17.510
Um... If Her Majesty Dianna were to come here, do you think she could prevent war from breaking out?

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:21.810
Of course. Her Majesty Dianna does indeed have that kind of power.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:25.440
I think so too. Before I left the moon,

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:28.100
she decided to give me a goodbye kiss.

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.230
That's certainly something to envy.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.030
Alright, you ready?

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.240
Looks like you're alright.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:39.120
I don't even know how many times I should've died by now.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:39.820
- Old man Sid!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.830
W-what's that?!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.120
Is it sand?

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.720
Captain Harry. If you're finished here,

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.430
why don't you allow this young man to leave?

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.430
Right. I was about to do just that.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.510
Then, if you'll excuse me...

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:05.680
You're better off returning home, you'll be able to protect your identity that way.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:06.230
Yes, sir.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.310
It'll make it much easier for us to sabatoge their efforts

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:11.020
and capture the mustached mobile suit.

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.650
Yes. I'll be going now.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.530
<i>Is war the only thing soldiers ever think about?</i>

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:22.910
Don't forget to write down the name of the speaker.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.120
Right. I understand.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.710
I have something to tell you, Milady.

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.380
<i>The stenographer may now enter the room.</i>

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.130
<i>Yes.</i>

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.130
Lady Kihel...

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:36.130
They're short on hands here, so I have to do stenography for them.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.720
You should stay here until the meeting is over.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:42.720
Please allow this boy to remain here for now!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:43.720
Who is he?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.520
<i>The family chauffeur.</i>

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.820
There's no way that could actually be her!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:55.110
She still has yet to arrive.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.110
Hey, are you really her chauffeur?

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.320
This driver's license was just assigned this year.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.620
Today we meet with them in person.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:08.410
We'll try to intimidate them with a confident attitude.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.210
Thanks for helping us out.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.630
There shouldn't be any more of that muddy sand, so don't worry.

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:22.640
This metal isn't from this mountain's mine.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:25.810
Joseph! What do you think this is?

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:29.480
What, indeed. It's not a normal machine, but...

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.730
<i>Is it an electrical circuit?</i>

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.940
<i>It looks like there's wires in it.</i>

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:34.900
Is there any room in there?

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:38.400
Yeah, but the air's fresh. It's really wide.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:44.410
I'm sure you've realized that our side possesses technology which is far superior to yours.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.620
And yet you too have seen the true power of our own mechanical doll.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.210
Our lone pilot, Laura, is no genius.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:55.000
Heh. So it's Laura's mustached mobile suit, yes?

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.420
Of course not.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:02.630
The father of my young stenographer here was killed during your brutal assault!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:07.810
If you simply handed over the Sunbelt Zone to us, we never would've attacked you.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:11.020
Your demands are selfishly one-sided!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.440
We've been negotiating this for two years.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:17.400
I was the one who told you that we have longed to return to our homeworld for the past two thousand years.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.610
You can't possibly suggest you don't recognize my voice--

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:24.240
No!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.950
If it's a duel you want, then draw your gun!

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:31.540
Stop this at once, Elder Inura!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.420
I'm sorry, but they killed my wife and nephew!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:40.340
Those people's powerful weapons are responsible for the death of the son my sister relied on!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.930
Toss your weapon aside, old man!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.640
You damned barbarian! You'll pay for this!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.810
That's the attitude shared by all of Inglessa!?

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.100
If blood is what you want, then kill me instead!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.060
However, the negotiations must go on!

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.940
Payback comes first!

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.320
E-Elder Inura!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:05.910
H-heir... Y-you must not be allowed to die...!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.700
Not here, Lieutenant.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.700
Don't think even for a second that some old man's death is equal payback for Captain Aji!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.410
Guin Rhineford!

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:18.330
We'll call a truce for now, however it is only temporary!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:20.130
<i>Get a stretcher! Take the Captain's body!</i>

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.510
<i>Get the Dianna Counter members out of here!</i>

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:27.720
This... A place so stained with blood isn't the right place for you, Lady Kihel.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.890
Lets go back to Vicinity.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:30.930
Good idea.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:34.230
Perhaps returning home would help your mother recover.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.310
Right.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:37.230
Laura, about your mechanical doll...

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.230
Sir?

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.230
No matter what, you must learn how to control it.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:43.230
I'll inform Colonel Michael and the others.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:44.820
Are we going to war?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:48.700
I never could have imagined this happening.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.170
I really hate this muggy air.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:58.830
Shit.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:21:59.920
L-Look!

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.500
Metal eggs? T-They're machines!

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:16.230
These are magnificent machines, just like the ones spoken of in the Dark History.

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:18.440
They look like they're brand new!

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:22.820
These are the Dark History's remnants!?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:44.150
<i>I never thought Her Majesty Dianna would actually come here.</i>

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:47.980
<i>Lady Sochie has finally become a militia pilot.</i>

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:52.660
<i>Lady Kihel is saddened by the effect this has on her mother,</i>

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:56.240
<i>and so I continue fighting to prevent things from becoming worse.</i>

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:00.540
<i>Next time, on Turn-A Gundam,</i>

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:02.080
<i>The Advent of Dianna.</i>

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>The Advent of Dianna</b>

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:05.130
"The wind has subsided."
